{"title":"Day Trip to Niagara Falls with Hiking 🌿💧","startsAt":"2026-10-03T08:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-03T20:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Day Trip to Niagara Falls with Hiking 🌿💧\n\nJoin the Shalom Catholic Community for a day of fresh air, nature, and good company as we head to Niagara Falls for a hike and a picnic!\n\nWe'll walk scenic trails along the Niagara Gorge, enjoy the view of the falls, and share a picnic lunch together. It's a great chance to take a break from the city, meet new people, and enjoy the fall colours before the cold weather arrives. Everyone is welcome, whether you're part of the community or joining us for the first time.\n\n📅 When: Saturday, October 3\n🕗 Departure: 8:00 AM from Toronto, [meeting point]\n🚗 Transportation: Carpooling available\n💵 Cost: $30.00 [e-transfer: economatotoronto@comshalom.org]\n📝 Registration: Required by Tuesday, September 29\n\nWhat to bring:\n\nYour own light lunch\nSomething to share for the group picnic\nComfortable walking shoes and weather-appropriate clothing\nWater bottle and sunscreen\n\nSpots in the carpool are limited, so please register early to save your seat!\ni\n📞 Questions? Contact us at 647 222 9875\n\n📸 Follow us on Instagram: @shalomtoronto\n\nWe can't wait to spend the day with you! 🙌","venue":{"name":"Niagara Falls","address":"Niagara falls, Toronto","lat":43.64786,"lng":-79.392914,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Catholic Hang-out / Social Group","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/c/4/e/highres_536272302.jpeg"}